  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(A) Water <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mover></math> ice; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p>(B) Water <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mover></math> ice; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p>(C) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p>(D) Adsorption; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p>(E) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCl</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p>",
